!csl4
!def
public-surface: apocky.com page available without account
doorway: public page describing access without granting conversation authority
actor-view: interface projection scoped to one principal and authorization state
mapping-residual: meaning or capability not safely translatable across actor views
promotion: deployment accepted only after source, browser, accessibility, and rollback evidence
!.

#P destination
#K apocky.com -> coherent-home + truthful-doorway + accessible-account-flow + machine-interface
#K audience -> people + digital-intelligences + language-models + developers
#K visual-language -> calm + legible + distinctive + responsive

#D invariants
#K authentication != authorization
#K account != conversation-access
#K route-exists != runtime-healthy
#K static-manifest != live-diagnostic
#K telemetry -> explicit-consent + revocable-choice + auth-blackout
#K camera -> visible-action + per-session-consent + immediate-stop
#K actor-view -> scoped-claims + scoped-authority + preserved-mapping-residual
#K private-data -> absent-from public-html + screenshots + telemetry + machine-manifest

#D flow
#K home -> choose(meet | talk | build | learn | trust)
#K talk -> doorway -> state(signed-out | member | owner | unavailable)
#K signed-out -> login(next=/chat)
#K member -> private-beta-explanation
#K owner -> conversation
#K login -> email-link | email-code | browser-pkce
#K callback -> verified-session -> safe-next

#D machine-interface
#K llms.txt -> human-readable-route-law
#K apocky.json -> typed-route-law
#K site-manifest-schema -> structural-validator
#K local-view-conflict -> explicit-residual != flattened-claim

#C promotion
#K source-check + outcome-tests + browser-matrix + accessibility-scan + production-build + canary-probe + rollback-proof -> promotion
#K failure -> preserve-evidence + repair + rerun
